Real coefficients for the element routines in this addon.

-----------------------------------

  1-100: all relevant real parameters from the stokes & viscoelastic add-on
101-150: reserved for diffuse_interface add-on
151-200: reserved for inertia add-on
201-250: reserved for generalized Stokes add-on
251-300: reserved for compressible_fluid add-on


301  deltat: timestep 

302  beta: SUPG factor

303  a: coefficient in damping function nr 2 (coefficients%i(366)=2)

304  alpha: coefficient in damping function nr 3 (PSM, coefficients%i(366)=3)

305  beta: coefficient in damping function nr 3 (PSM, coefficients%i(366)=3)

306  Uglobal: velocity scaling used in SUPG for coefficients%i(368)==1
     (check for zero velocity).

307-350 reserved for future use

-----------------------------------

Real arrays in ra:

  1: size N+1 (N=coefficients%i(353)), where the N+1 age points tau_j, 0=1,...,N
     need to be given (the array is coefficients%ra(1)%a).

  2: size >=nummodes=coefficients%i(365), where the moduli G_i are given by 
        G_i = coefficients%ra(2)%a(i), i=1,...,n

  3: size >=nummodes=coefficients%i(365), where the relaxation times lambda_i
     are given by 
        lambda_i = coefficients%ra(3)%a(i), i=1,...,n

  4: size >=nummodes=coefficients%i(365), where the power-law exponents n_i are
     given by 
        n_i = coefficients%ra(4)%a(i), i=1,...,n
     NOTE: only needed for spectrum=coefficients%i(364)=2 and only for the
           power-law (Carreau) modes.
